      "updated_at": "2026-05-09T04:39:35Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "b608626f665d",
      "text": "” 林渡川的目光瞬间锁定在她身上，两人对视的瞬间，空气仿佛凝固。",
      "status": "open",
      "first_volume": null,
      "first_chapter": 2,
      "first_title": "都分不旧案",
      "mentions": 2,
      "history": [
        {
          "volume": null,
